{
  "template": "You are a content validity expert evaluating scale items for a measurement instrument.\n\nScenario context:\n{scenario}\n\nDimension: {dimension}\nDimension description: {dimension_desc}\n\nItem to evaluate:\n\"{item_text}\"\n\nPlease rate the item using the following 4-point relevance scale:\n1 = Irrelevant: not related to the dimension\n2 = Needs major revision: somewhat related but requires substantial changes\n3 = Minor revision: mostly relevant but needs small wording edits\n4 = Highly relevant: clearly matches the dimension and needs no revision\n\nReturn only valid JSON with the fields:\n- score: integer 1-4\n- comment: short explanation of the relevance judgment or suggestion for improvement\n\nExample output:\n{"score": 3, "comment": "The item is relevant but could be more specific to robot assistance behavior."}"
}
